    {
      "text": "Nine heavenly star sweat is a rank nine immortal material and one of the three waters of heaven and earth, together with myriad being creation water and rising falling tide water. It has extreme value and is rare even among rank nine immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        1779
      ],
