        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If the nine heavens still stood, nine colored water at heavenly dew oasis would yield one drop of nine heavenly star sweat each year under the rays of the stars, moon, and sun from those heavens. Unlike the three fires of heaven and earth, nine heavenly star sweat among the three waters has already vanished, because seven of the nine heavens are gone and only two remain.",
